# ========== MakeFriends 根目录 .gitignore ==========

# --- Java / Maven 构建产物 ---
**/target/
**/*.class
**/*.jar
**/*.war
**/build/
**/out/

# --- Node / 前端构建产物 ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
*.local
.pnpm-store/

# --- 上传文件目录（运行时生成，不入库）---
**/uploads/

# --- 日志 ---
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- 编辑器 & 系统 ---
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# --- 敏感配置 ---
.env
.env.local
*.bak
*.pyc
